          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iwapo kuna njaa nchini au tauni, ukame, ugonjwa wa mimea, nzige au viwavi, au ikiwa watu wako wamezingirwa na maadui zao katika mji wao wowote ule; ikiwa kuna pigo lolote au ugonjwa wowote, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tafadhali usikie maombi yoyote yatakayoombwa na mtu yeyote au watu wako wote wa Israeli, kila mtu akijua taabu yake na huzuni yake akikuomba huku akinyosha mikono yake kuelekea nyumba hii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi usikie kutoka kwako mbinguni, utoe msamaha, pia umtendee kila mtu kadiri anavyostahili, kwani ni wewe tu ujuaye mawazo ya mioyo ya wanadamu wote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo watakutii na kuenenda katika njia zako wakati wote wanapoishi katika nchi uliyowapa babu zetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
